---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms — Good Apollo Goods"
  description="Terms for using and shopping the Good Apollo Goods website."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Terms"
    title="Website & shop terms."
    intro="Practical terms for browsing and ordering ready-to-ship pieces from Good Apollo Goods."
  />
  <section class="container policy">
    <p class="policy-date">Last updated September 2026</p>
    <h2>Product information</h2>
    <p>
      Each piece is handmade in a small batch. Minor variations in color,
      texture, and construction are part of handmade production. Product pages
      provide the most current materials, sizing, and availability.
    </p>
    <h2>Pricing and availability</h2>
    <p>
      Prices are in U.S. dollars, excluding applicable tax. Shipping and tax are
      shown before payment in Stripe checkout. A cart does not reserve stock.
      Starting checkout creates a temporary reservation, normally for 35
      minutes. Payment must be confirmed before an order can be packed.
    </p>
    <h2>Review before ordering</h2>
    <p>
      Customers are responsible for reviewing all product details before
      ordering, including measurements when provided, listed dimensions,
      materials, color, care, and intended use. Please contact the studio with
      questions before purchase.
    </p>
    <h2>Final sale</h2>
    <p>
      All sales are final. Good Apollo Goods does not offer returns, exchanges,
      repairs, or routine refunds. For an incorrect, damaged or missing order,
      contact the studio so the problem can be reviewed.
    </p>
    <h2>Delivery</h2>
    <p>
      The shop ships ready-to-ship stock within the United States, including
      Alaska and Hawaii. The current flat shipping charge and processing window
      appear on <a href="/shipping/">the shipping page</a> and are confirmed
      before payment. Carrier transit time is separate from processing time.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@goodapollogoods.com">hello@goodapollogoods.com</a>{' '}
      with questions about these terms.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
